  <trk>
    <name>Crest da Tiarms Trail</name>
    <desc>The Crest da Tiarms Trail is a challenging single trail in alpine terrain. It starts off spectacularly along the ridge, then continues over technical descents with short climbs far away from civilisation. Not for the faint-hearted!</desc>
    <type>mountainbiking</type>
